                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 2.</seg></opener>
                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <p>The imperial consent is given to the treaties, and you will therefore undertake
                    the necessary arrangements in connection therewith.</p>
                <p>To <hi rendition="#small-caps">Iyemotshi,</hi> (Tycoon’s name.)</p>
